<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Xerox estimates raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Xerox estimates raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Securities raised its earnings estimates and price target on Xerox Corp, a Prudential source said.</p>
<p>-- said raised the full year 1997 estimate to $3.95 a share from $3.80.</p>
<p>-- said raised the second quarter estimate to $0.87 a share from $0.84.</p>
<p>-- said raised the price target to $85 from $78.</p>
<p>-- Xerox gained 1-7/8 to 69-1/4.</p>
</text>
